meta {
  name: Cart
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/cart
}

docs {
  Grouped by shop, because a MonaFind cart is nearly always multi-seller — a
  buyer fixing one car buys the filter from one shop and the mirror from a
  breaker, and pays for both at once as one order group of several orders.

  The cart re-checks itself on every read. `notices` says what changed since
  the buyer last looked and whether it stops them paying; a price rise does
  not, because they have now been shown it.
}
